<title>FRANCE: SGS-Thomson Q3 net rises 7.1 pct.</title>
<headline>SGS-Thomson Q3 net rises 7.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to Sept 28, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>    Net earnings				 132.4  vs	   129.0</p>
<p>    Net earnings per share (dollars)	0.95  vs	    1.00</p>
<p>    Operating				    167.4  vs	   166.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax					164.2  vs	   159.6</p>
<p>    Net interest expense			 3.2  vs	     6.7</p>
<p>    Net revenues				 988.4  vs	   922.6</p>
<p>    Cost of sales				589.2  vs	   522.3</p>
<p>-- Nine months to Sept 28</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>    Net earnings	   483.5  vs	   358.5</p>
<p>    Net earnings per share ($) 3.49  vs	    2.78</p>
<p>    Operating		     612.4  vs	   465.6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			 614.4  vs	   450.9</p>
<p>    Net interest expens	   5.3  vs	    14.7</p>
<p>    Net revenues		3,024.4  vs	 2,553.7</p>
<p>    Cost of sales	     1,757.7  vs	 1,530.9</p>
<p>NOTE - SGS-Thomson Microelectronics BV gave the figures in a statement</p>
</text>
